// The valley talks about the Gilded Vale (1.4): conversation topics, so each person says
// their line once, the next time you talk to them, without touching their everyday lines.
//   blinxxy.MuseArt_ValeOpened: from the morning Lupini's letter arrives, for a season (so
//     Julian, who visits the 22nd to the 24th, has a visit inside it).
//   blinxxy.MuseArt_ValeVisited: after your first step off the bus in the Vale, for two weeks.
// Who says what follows the residents' briefs: Gus and Bea swap recipes, Sable and Lupini
// nod, Leah went once and never went back (her story, 1.5), Evelyn and Caroline trade with
// Fern, Clint talks kilns with Tobin, Robin buys his planters, Sam's in awe of Emmett, and
// Julian has forgotten the review that made Lupini.
